abstract: >
  Independent, satellite-based measurement, reporting, and verification
  of a real, publicly documented carbon credit project's claimed
  sequestration, checking a registry's numbers against GEDI biomass,
  Sentinel-2 canopy data, and OCO-2/3 atmospheric CO2.
